---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import Nav from "@/components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import { person, toolsRepo } from "@/data/site";
---

<Base
  title="Tools Privacy Policy · devsam"
  description="Privacy policy for Samuel Ogbodo's browser tools hub. Most tools process files locally in your browser."
  showAds={false}
>
  <Nav />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="pt-36 pb-20 sm:pt-44 sm:pb-28">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8">
        <p class="label reveal"><span class="text-accent">Privacy</span> / Tools hub</p>
        <h1 class="reveal mt-4 text-[clamp(2.25rem,6vw,4rem)] leading-[0.98] font-semibold tracking-[-0.045em] text-balance">Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="reveal mt-6 text-sm text-subtle">Last updated 25 November 2026</p>

        <div class="reveal mt-12 space-y-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">The short version</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">The tools linked from this hub are designed to run in your browser. For normal use, files and text you open in a tool are processed on your device and are not uploaded to my servers.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Files and text</h2>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-[10px] size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Most processing happens locally using JavaScript and WebAssembly in your browser.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-[10px] size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>I do not run a backend that receives your files for normal tool use.</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-[10px] size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Some tools may save settings or recent text in your browser's local storage so you can pick up where you left off. That data stays on your device until you clear it.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Third-party resources</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">Some tools download code libraries or AI models from third-party CDNs or model hosts when needed. Those providers may receive normal technical request data, such as your IP address. The tool pages explain when this happens. For example, Background Remover may download its AI engine/model on first use.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Hosting</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">This site is hosted on Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare may process basic technical data, such as IP addresses, to serve pages and protect against abuse. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-fg underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Advertising</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">This tools hub may show ads through Google AdSense in the future. If ads are enabled, Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies to serve and measure ads, including personalised ads where consent is required. You can learn more at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-fg underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent">How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Analytics</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">I do not use analytics or tracking scripts on this tools hub.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Open source</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">The tools source code is public under the MIT license: <a href={toolsRepo} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-fg underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent">{toolsRepo.replace("https://", "")}</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Contact</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${person.email}`} class="text-fg underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent">{person.email}</a>.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>